<i>We now bring you the latest report</i>.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.100
<i>The demolition mission of Junius Seven was a success,</i>

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:04.060
<i>but falling fragments may still cause significant damage.</i>

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.480
<i>Unfortunately we cannot determine where the fragments will fall at this time</i>.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.940
